  "title": "Flash Next CUDA: the PLE gather keeps a parked worker pool instead of spawning threads per call",
  "user": {
    "login": "jschmied",
    "id": 600316,
    "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDMxNg==",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/600316?v=4",
